WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.860
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.130 --> 01:43.960
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.110 --> 01:46.920
[Episode 15]

4
01:49.280 --> 01:50.430
I've made the pros and cons of the surgery

5
01:50.430 --> 01:52.310
very clear, haven't I?

6
01:54.039 --> 01:55.070
So I hope you can

7
01:55.070 --> 01:57.070
make a decision as soon as possible.

8
02:02.790 --> 02:04.510
How about we just don't do it?

9
02:04.680 --> 02:06.510
It might not even cure me.

10
02:06.950 --> 02:08.400
And it'll cost a fortune.

11
02:08.400 --> 02:09.520
Who are you putting on

12
02:09.520 --> 02:10.560
this show for now?

13
02:09.600 --> 02:12.660
[Please don't spit out the window. Please put your trash in the trash can.]

14
02:11.120 --> 02:11.470
Isn't it

15
02:11.470 --> 02:12.750
our money you are talking about?

16
02:12.750 --> 02:13.400
Exactly.

17
02:13.400 --> 02:14.870
Stop acting like someone's abusing you.

18
02:14.870 --> 02:16.470
What if the surgery goes wrong?

19
02:16.470 --> 02:17.680
If I end up paralyzed,

20
02:19.000 --> 02:19.870
wouldn't I really become

21
02:19.870 --> 02:21.079
an old burden?

22
02:22.870 --> 02:23.840
At my age,

23
02:24.910 --> 02:26.570
I'll just live as long as I can.

24
02:27.560 --> 02:28.710
If one day, I really

25
02:28.710 --> 02:29.280
can't move,

26
02:29.280 --> 02:30.870
I'll just die on the street,

27
02:30.910 --> 02:32.030
so you'll have peace.

28
02:32.030 --> 02:32.560
Sir, you...

29
02:32.560 --> 02:34.630
Dad, what are you talking about?

30
02:34.960 --> 02:36.960
What do you mean by dying on the street?

31
02:36.960 --> 02:38.310
What would the doctor

32
02:36.990 --> 02:39.190
[Please don't spit out the window. Please put your trash in the trash can.]

33
02:38.360 --> 02:39.360
think of us?

34
02:39.360 --> 02:40.960
Alright, I'll stop talking.

35
02:41.430 --> 02:42.360
How about you

36
02:42.470 --> 02:43.680
take more time to discuss it?

37
02:43.680 --> 02:45.310
When you've made a decision,

38
02:45.310 --> 02:46.630
just tell a nurse

39
02:46.630 --> 02:47.829
or the doctor on duty.

40
02:48.079 --> 02:49.740
The office is right next door.

41
02:50.190 --> 02:50.630
Come on.

42
02:50.630 --> 02:51.960
Now you're not talking.

43
02:52.150 --> 02:53.030
Why are you playing the victim

44
02:53.030 --> 02:54.290
in front of the doctor?

45
02:56.340 --> 03:00.870
[Accessible Route—Please Keep Clear]

46
02:56.870 --> 02:57.400
Dad.

47
02:57.400 --> 02:59.520
You're going to drive Li Zhi crazy if you keep this up.

48
02:59.520 --> 03:01.150
We're family.

49
03:01.150 --> 03:02.840
Can't you just make everything clear?

50
03:02.840 --> 03:04.800
Just stop pushing me!

51
03:04.800 --> 03:06.560
Come on! I'm just trying to talk this out with you!

52
03:06.560 --> 03:07.890
How is that pushing you?

53
03:07.910 --> 03:09.470
What kind of people are they?

54
03:09.470 --> 03:11.270
Why are you so stubborn, old man?

55
03:11.310 --> 03:12.970
What does it have to do with me?

56
03:13.000 --> 03:14.120
Why would I be mad?

57
03:14.840 --> 03:15.680
Like a psycho.

58
03:17.079 --> 03:17.960
Dr. Che.

59
03:18.470 --> 03:19.800
What are you doing here?

60
03:20.800 --> 03:22.130
Getting some fresh air.

61
03:22.960 --> 03:24.079
Why are you here?

62
03:24.400 --> 03:25.079
I just got a call

63
03:25.079 --> 03:26.590
from a patient's family.

64
03:26.800 --> 03:27.800
I guess things...

65
03:28.150 --> 03:29.150
aren't looking good.

66
03:29.150 --> 03:30.880
I'm here to see what's going on.

67
03:31.240 --> 03:32.520
Look at me. I forgot

68
03:32.520 --> 03:34.450
you have business at our hospital.

69
03:34.630 --> 03:36.430
I thought you came to see Dr. Liu.

70
03:41.470 --> 03:42.470
I'm sorry.

71
03:42.800 --> 03:44.280
You see, sometimes I speak

72
03:44.430 --> 03:45.490
without thinking.

73
03:46.120 --> 03:46.910
It's fine.

74
03:47.800 --> 03:49.430
It's not a secret.

75
03:50.520 --> 03:52.150
I did pursue him before.

76
03:52.280 --> 03:54.280
It's just that it didn't succeed,

77
03:54.280 --> 03:55.470
and he ran away.

78
03:58.630 --> 03:59.360
I actually feel

79
03:59.360 --> 04:00.870
he's not quite good enough for you.

80
04:00.870 --> 04:01.470
Really?

81
04:03.120 --> 04:04.150
I think so too.

82
04:04.400 --> 04:05.150
Right?

83
04:05.630 --> 04:07.890
I mean, besides his good medical skills,

84
04:08.030 --> 04:09.520
his straightforwardness,

85
04:09.520 --> 04:11.360
and his seriousness in doing things,

86
04:11.360 --> 04:12.620
he has no other merits.

87
04:13.240 --> 04:14.470
That's true.

88
04:14.910 --> 04:16.430
He is so mean.

89
04:16.829 --> 04:17.829
And he has a low alcohol tolerance.

90
04:17.829 --> 04:18.800
To be honest,

91
04:19.160 --> 04:20.430
I'm quite charming.

92
04:20.480 --> 04:21.390
Absolutely.

93
04:21.390 --> 04:22.160
But he still doesn't think I'm good enough for him.

94
04:22.160 --> 04:23.040
He deserves to be single forever.

95
04:23.040 --> 04:24.160
The ad was just posted a few days ago,

96
04:24.160 --> 04:25.120
and he is already gone.

97
04:25.120 --> 04:26.310
Isn't this a scam?

98
04:26.310 --> 04:27.040
Exactly.

99
04:27.040 --> 04:27.630
We even made a special trip

100
04:27.630 --> 04:29.160
from so far away.

101
04:29.160 --> 04:30.000
What a rip-off!

102
04:30.000 --> 04:31.240
What a lousy hospital.

103
04:31.240 --> 04:32.500
I'm never coming back.

104
04:34.370 --> 04:39.710
[Xiaoximen Hospital] [Liu Zhengliang]

105
04:40.820 --> 04:46.500
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

106
04:50.990 --> 04:53.690
[Accessible Route] [Hospital Admission Registration]

107
04:53.800 --> 05:01.040
[Huahai Road]

108
04:56.159 --> 04:58.290
Why is it getting more and more remote?

109
04:58.430 --> 05:00.160
A good business doesn't need a prime location to thrive.

110
05:00.160 --> 05:00.950
You know?

111
05:01.040 --> 05:02.500
[Jiajiale Department Store]

112
05:01.560 --> 05:02.490
It's just ahead.

113
05:04.160 --> 05:05.020
This is the one.

114
05:05.310 --> 05:06.310
My family runs it.

115
05:07.480 --> 05:08.600
Don't mind the small space.

116
05:08.600 --> 05:10.120
It's kept quite clean.

117
05:10.310 --> 05:11.750
At the internet cafe,

118
05:11.750 --> 05:13.070
I promised you the discounted rate

119
05:13.070 --> 05:14.000
of 50 a day.

120
05:14.390 --> 05:15.600
At this price point,

121
05:15.600 --> 05:17.190
even if you searched the whole city with a lantern,

122
05:17.190 --> 05:19.270
you wouldn't find another place like this.

123
05:19.270 --> 05:20.600
See? This one is no good.

124
05:21.950 --> 05:22.830
Also,

125
05:23.390 --> 05:25.800
I'll lend you my laptop so you can send out your resume.

126
05:25.800 --> 05:27.200
I'm a good friend, right?

127
05:28.800 --> 05:29.600
Come on.

128
05:34.800 --> 05:36.480
You're back so early today.

129
05:36.510 --> 05:37.800
That's rare.

130
05:41.600 --> 05:43.260
This is a guest I brought back.

131
05:43.360 --> 05:44.159
I promised him

132
05:44.159 --> 05:45.000
50 a day.

133
05:45.750 --> 05:46.880
Give him a good room.

134
05:49.950 --> 05:50.880
How many people?

135
05:51.720 --> 05:52.510
Just me.

136
05:53.830 --> 05:54.630
ID card.

137
06:03.240 --> 06:04.390
Temporary ID card.

138
06:04.630 --> 06:06.510
It has the same validity as a regular ID.

139
06:06.510 --> 06:07.480
I know.

140
06:08.070 --> 06:09.240
Just checking if it's real.

141
06:09.240 --> 06:10.040
Look here.

142
06:14.480 --> 06:15.390
We have rooms available today.

143
06:15.390 --> 06:16.390
I'll upgrade you

144
06:16.390 --> 06:17.480
to a VIP deluxe room.

145
06:17.480 --> 06:18.870
What style do you like?

146
06:19.310 --> 06:20.310
Anything is fine.

147
06:20.600 --> 06:22.480
100 as a deposit. Scan here.

148
06:27.680 --> 06:29.240
Receipt, ID card,

149
06:30.160 --> 06:30.950
room card.

150
06:32.000 --> 06:33.460
Go upstairs and turn left.

151
07:26.190 --> 07:27.870
I saved a complete stranger,

152
07:28.430 --> 07:29.750
lost all my luggage,

153
07:30.310 --> 07:31.720
and moved into

154
07:32.040 --> 07:33.700
a place I can't even describe.

155
07:35.630 --> 07:37.190
This is what they call fate.

156
07:54.740 --> 07:55.409
[Page Directory]

157
07:55.430 --> 07:57.560
[Cervical Spine Health: Current Issues and Pain Points]

158
07:57.580 --> 07:58.290
[Product Overview]

159
07:59.480 --> 08:01.740
The night shift is so hard to get through.

160
08:02.800 --> 08:04.000
But you used to be

161
08:04.000 --> 08:05.600
the most energetic one on night shifts.

162
08:05.600 --> 08:06.360
Speaking of which,

163
08:05.730 --> 08:11.390
[Yellow Emperor's Inner Canon]

164
08:06.360 --> 08:08.390
no one is more energetic on night shifts

165
08:08.390 --> 08:09.800
than Liu Zhengliang.

166
08:09.800 --> 08:11.460
That guy is really energetic.

167
08:12.680 --> 08:13.870
How do you think he's doing?

168
08:13.680 --> 08:16.070
[Yellow Emperor's Inner Canon]

169
08:14.190 --> 08:15.650
Has he started his new job?

170
08:19.190 --> 08:20.120
You're asking me?

171
08:20.120 --> 08:20.830
How would I know?

172
08:20.830 --> 08:22.030
He didn't contact me.

173
08:27.310 --> 08:29.600
Speak of the devil.

174
08:30.430 --> 08:31.600
He's calling.

175
08:34.360 --> 08:35.150
Zhengliang.

176
08:35.150 --> 08:35.840
Are you there?

177
08:35.840 --> 08:36.549
We were just talking about you,

178
08:36.549 --> 08:37.750
and you called.

179
08:38.390 --> 08:39.650
Don't even mention it.

180
08:39.870 --> 08:40.630
I'm in Bengbu.

181
08:40.630 --> 08:41.510
Bengbu?

182
08:42.480 --> 08:44.340
The Bengbu like in "Bengbu Turn?"

183
08:44.670 --> 08:45.840
Why are you there?

184
08:46.240 --> 08:47.480
It's a long story.

185
08:48.270 --> 08:49.480
Anyway,

186
08:50.960 --> 08:52.510
I lost all my luggage,

187
08:53.200 --> 08:55.400
and I reported the loss of my bank cards.

188
08:57.480 --> 08:59.010
The most important thing is

189
08:59.480 --> 09:07.740
[Dream Garden Themed Hotel]

190
09:00.000 --> 09:01.320
I'm staying in a

191
09:01.910 --> 09:03.550
very weird hotel right now,

192
09:04.120 --> 09:04.790
listening to

193
09:04.790 --> 09:06.450
disturbing noises next door.

194
09:06.790 --> 09:07.550
Damn it.

195
09:08.670 --> 09:11.270
This is the second time I've heard you say that.

196
09:12.720 --> 09:15.240
You can't blame Xiaoximen Hospital this time.

197
09:15.240 --> 09:16.200
What should I do?

198
09:17.870 --> 09:18.870
Do you think

199
09:19.720 --> 09:21.450
Long Dongdong knew it all along

200
09:21.750 --> 09:22.600
and is messing with me on purpose?

201
09:22.600 --> 09:23.600
No way.

202
09:25.150 --> 09:27.080
Mr. Long might be unreliable with small things,

203
09:27.080 --> 09:28.670
but he's always reliable with big things.

204
09:28.670 --> 09:30.200
Reliable?

205
09:30.390 --> 09:31.480
He asked me to go back.

206
09:31.480 --> 09:32.810
Isn't that ridiculous?

207
09:33.750 --> 09:35.320
How could I go back?

208
09:35.480 --> 09:36.600
Even if you wanted to come back now,

209
09:36.600 --> 09:37.630
you couldn't.

210
09:37.630 --> 09:38.830
Right after you left,

211
09:39.320 --> 09:41.720
they started discussing staff cuts.

212
09:42.600 --> 09:43.630
Everyone inside

213
09:43.630 --> 09:46.480
and outside the hospital is panicking.

214
09:49.120 --> 09:50.050
What do you mean?

215
09:50.550 --> 09:52.950
Alright, let's not talk about this for now.

216
09:53.510 --> 09:53.960
You...

217
09:53.960 --> 09:55.600
Just stay put there.

218
09:56.670 --> 09:57.600
Wait a minute.

219
09:58.670 --> 09:59.480
Hello?

220
10:00.000 --> 10:01.600
Why not let everyone listen?

221
10:01.630 --> 10:03.320
It's a private matter.

222
10:04.200 --> 10:05.870
I'll go out and talk.

223
10:08.550 --> 10:09.790
He lost everything?

224
10:09.790 --> 10:10.480
Brother.

225
10:10.960 --> 10:12.670
Do you think he'll come back?

226
10:12.670 --> 10:13.790
Absolutely not.

227
10:12.850 --> 10:17.590
[Yellow Emperor's Inner Canon]

228
10:15.030 --> 10:17.270
His heart is completely broken.

229
10:22.440 --> 10:24.000
Do you think Xiaoximen Hospital

230
10:23.880 --> 10:30.760
[Yellow Emperor's Inner Canon]

231
10:24.000 --> 10:25.600
will really make staff cuts?

232
10:26.670 --> 10:28.510
We're the backbone of this hospital.

233
10:28.510 --> 10:29.000
No matter what,

234
10:29.000 --> 10:30.440
they won't lay us off.

235
10:34.870 --> 10:36.150
I'm really doomed this time.

236
10:36.150 --> 10:37.870
Nonsense.

237
10:38.320 --> 10:39.840
They scheduled you for surgery, right?

238
10:39.840 --> 10:41.000
How did you know?

239
10:41.300 --> 10:47.580
[Dream Garden Themed Hotel]

240
10:41.480 --> 10:42.280
How did I know?

241
10:42.630 --> 10:43.760
You're so carefree.

242
10:44.440 --> 10:45.440
Only surgery

243
10:45.440 --> 10:46.640
can make you anxious.

244
10:48.030 --> 10:49.840
No one knows a father better than his son.

245
10:49.840 --> 10:50.630
Get lost.

246
10:51.670 --> 10:53.120
Chief Physician Tong will be the lead surgeon,

247
10:53.120 --> 10:54.670
and I'll be the second assistant.

248
10:54.670 --> 10:55.550
Help me think of a way

249
10:55.550 --> 10:56.550
to refuse it.

250
10:57.480 --> 10:58.630
Refuse it?

251
11:00.720 --> 11:01.520
What surgery?

252
11:01.960 --> 11:03.670
CAS.

253
11:04.910 --> 11:06.360
It's a minor surgery.

254
11:07.720 --> 11:09.360
If it were as easy as you say,

255
11:09.360 --> 11:10.490
that would be great.

256
11:11.670 --> 11:13.320
I told you before.

257
11:14.000 --> 11:15.630
No surgery is too small.

258
11:17.510 --> 11:19.960
You even get anxious about an appendectomy.

259
11:19.960 --> 11:21.120
Just tell him directly

260
11:21.120 --> 11:22.270
that you don't want to do it.

261
11:22.270 --> 11:23.080
Come on.

262
11:24.030 --> 11:25.270
If only it were as simple

263
11:25.270 --> 11:26.240
as you say.

264
11:26.240 --> 11:27.000
It's just one sentence.

265
11:27.000 --> 11:28.330
What's so hard about it?

266
11:28.600 --> 11:30.390
People are just different.

267
11:31.120 --> 11:32.750
It's not as simple as you said.

268
11:32.750 --> 11:34.630
Just keep turning in Bengbu.

269
11:32.800 --> 11:40.870
[Dream Garden]

270
11:37.030 --> 11:38.150
Fine. I'm done talking to you.

271
11:38.150 --> 11:39.150
There's no way to make you understand.

272
11:39.150 --> 11:40.000
That's it.

273
11:50.190 --> 11:51.080
[Chen Junnan] [Transfer]

274
11:51.110 --> 11:51.640
[Tell me if you need money]

275
12:01.390 --> 12:03.320
Come on. How did I steal your money?

276
12:03.750 --> 12:04.840
Your money was just sitting there.

277
12:04.840 --> 12:05.910
I spent it to save you face.

278
12:05.910 --> 12:06.630
You know?

279
12:06.670 --> 12:07.720
You should thank me.

280
12:07.720 --> 12:08.790
I should thank you?

281
12:09.030 --> 12:10.600
Thank you for doing nothing useful every day.

282
12:10.600 --> 12:12.060
You don't do any real work.

283
12:12.080 --> 12:13.320
Come on. What do you know?

284
12:13.320 --> 12:15.360
This is called surviving in society.

285
12:15.360 --> 12:16.360
If you keep this up,

286
12:16.360 --> 12:17.360
I really won't care about you anymore.

287
12:17.360 --> 12:18.790
What are we to each other that you should care?

288
12:18.790 --> 12:19.510
Don't worry.

289
12:19.510 --> 12:21.840
Even if I die out there, I won't need you to care!

290
12:21.840 --> 12:22.910
Where are you going?

291
12:22.910 --> 12:24.170
None of your business!

292
12:29.840 --> 12:30.600
What are you doing?

293
12:30.600 --> 12:31.720
I can't tell you off a little,

294
12:31.720 --> 12:32.390
right?

295
12:33.000 --> 12:34.670
Just stop nagging.

296
12:40.900 --> 12:46.720
[Dream Garden]

297
12:44.600 --> 12:46.130
Why aren't you in the hotel?

298
12:47.600 --> 12:50.130
The soundproofing in this hotel is terrible.

299
12:53.630 --> 12:54.440
Here.

300
12:55.440 --> 12:56.440
I'm not drinking.

301
13:03.160 --> 13:07.950
[Shop for Sale]

302
13:10.630 --> 13:12.090
That woman is uneducated.

303
13:12.510 --> 13:15.440
When she gets angry, her language gets pretty harsh.

304
13:18.000 --> 13:18.790
However,

305
13:18.910 --> 13:20.720
she has a saying she always uses:

306
13:22.790 --> 13:24.720
"No matter how unlucky you are now,

307
13:25.790 --> 13:26.600
something good

308
13:26.600 --> 13:28.600
might happen the very next second."

309
13:29.510 --> 13:31.240
Do you think that makes sense?

310
13:35.440 --> 13:36.270
I hope so.

311
13:38.910 --> 13:39.790
Who is she?

312
13:41.600 --> 13:43.260
Theoretically, she's my mom.

313
13:43.910 --> 13:45.630
But I've cut ties with her.

314
13:49.510 --> 13:50.270
Why?

315
13:53.080 --> 13:54.840
Youth. Rebellion.

316
13:55.510 --> 13:57.510
Living wild and free.

317
13:58.240 --> 13:59.370
You know what I mean?

318
14:05.360 --> 14:06.030
Here,

319
14:06.480 --> 14:07.480
have a sip to calm your nerves.

320
14:07.480 --> 14:08.910
I told you I'm not drinking.

321
14:08.910 --> 14:09.720
Just try it.

322
14:24.910 --> 14:25.770
How's it taste?

323
14:26.000 --> 14:26.960
Too sweet.

324
14:38.440 --> 14:39.630
That'll be 3 yuan.

325
14:40.320 --> 14:41.790
QR code or cash?

326
14:59.750 --> 15:01.270
Even one sip is 3 yuan!

327
15:04.720 --> 15:06.930
[Flower of Wealth KTV]

328
15:08.630 --> 15:09.390
What?

329
15:10.030 --> 15:11.630
You wanna pick up where you left off?

330
15:11.630 --> 15:12.270
Yes.

331
15:12.750 --> 15:14.840
Well, you worked 10 days,

332
15:14.840 --> 15:16.030
then took off without a word.

333
15:16.030 --> 15:17.440
You didn't even come to say goodbye.

334
15:17.440 --> 15:18.150
What?

335
15:18.270 --> 15:18.840
Weren't you happy

336
15:18.840 --> 15:20.000
working here?

337
15:20.000 --> 15:20.840
No.

338
15:21.120 --> 15:23.510
I just figured you were busy

339
15:23.510 --> 15:24.750
and didn't want to bother you.

340
15:24.750 --> 15:26.280
I was perfectly happy here.

341
15:29.630 --> 15:30.150
Jie.

342
15:30.150 --> 15:31.240
Jie is short-staffed on the first floor.

343
15:31.240 --> 15:32.390
Go with him.

344
15:32.510 --> 15:33.320
Mr. Wu.

345
15:33.870 --> 15:35.840
I'm here this time to apply for

346
15:35.840 --> 15:37.390
that job you told me about.

347
15:37.390 --> 15:39.720
The one that pays over 10,000 yuan a month.

348
15:41.720 --> 15:42.790
Wh-What?

349
15:47.240 --> 15:48.240
Mr. Wu, look.

350
15:48.870 --> 15:50.240
Don't the four of us look like a boy band

351
15:50.240 --> 15:51.510
standing here together?

352
15:51.510 --> 15:52.570
Like quadruplets.

353
15:53.440 --> 15:54.970
You want to be my assistant?

354
15:55.150 --> 15:56.080
Didn't you say I had

355
15:56.080 --> 15:57.790
what it takes when I was working here?

356
15:57.790 --> 15:59.480
Take another look at me. Check out...

357
15:59.480 --> 16:00.440
this physique.

358
16:02.670 --> 16:03.480
Last time...

359
16:03.790 --> 16:05.120
Last time, when President Long

360
16:05.120 --> 16:06.000
brought you here,

361
16:06.000 --> 16:07.360
you might have had good qualifications.

362
16:07.360 --> 16:08.480
But now that you're here on your own,

363
16:08.480 --> 16:10.480
that's a different story.

364
16:10.480 --> 16:10.960
No matter what,

365
16:10.960 --> 16:13.890
you have to go through the hiring process, don't you?

366
16:14.080 --> 16:15.670
Sure. What's the process?

367
16:17.000 --> 16:17.840
An interview.

368
16:18.630 --> 16:19.360
Stand up.

369
16:25.630 --> 16:27.440
Young man, what's your educational background?

370
16:27.440 --> 16:29.200
Fucheng Polytechnic Vocational College.

371
16:29.200 --> 16:30.460
I studied accounting.

372
16:30.630 --> 16:31.890
What did you do before?

373
16:34.270 --> 16:36.200
I used to work in a funeral supply shop,

374
16:36.200 --> 16:37.320
selling urns.

375
16:43.120 --> 16:44.150
I... I don't need to be an assistant.

376
16:44.150 --> 16:44.790
Is that not okay?

377
16:44.790 --> 16:46.240
I'll just keep being a waiter, Jie.

378
16:46.240 --> 16:47.600
Zhengguang, just listen to me.

379
16:47.600 --> 16:48.720
Just go.

380
16:47.710 --> 16:56.380
[Flower of Wealth]

381
16:49.030 --> 16:50.910
Mr. Wu is very superstitious.

382
16:51.240 --> 16:53.320
If he had known you worked in the funeral business,

383
16:53.320 --> 16:54.120
you wouldn't have even lasted

384
16:54.120 --> 16:55.150
10 days as a waiter.

385
16:55.150 --> 16:56.840
Even President Long wouldn't be able to help.

386
16:56.840 --> 16:58.080
What's wrong with working in the funeral business?

387
16:58.080 --> 16:59.200
Everyone has to face their final day someday.

388
16:59.200 --> 17:00.390
Yes, that's right.

389
17:00.600 --> 17:02.120
Everyone knows it in their hearts,

390
17:02.120 --> 17:04.030
but no one talks about it, right?

391
17:04.720 --> 17:06.750
Anyway, say no more.

392
17:07.960 --> 17:09.960
The boss is watching from upstairs.

393
17:10.160 --> 17:11.680
Go away. Go away.

394
17:11.680 --> 17:12.510
Otherwise, he'll call me

395
17:12.510 --> 17:13.970
and tell me to kick you out.

396
17:14.349 --> 17:15.310
Just go.

397
17:15.720 --> 17:16.589
Alright, Jie.

398
17:20.069 --> 17:21.069
How are you doing?

399
17:26.480 --> 17:29.890
[Gong's Blind Massage]

400
17:29.890 --> 17:34.010
[Loosen Up Your Muscles and Joints. Works Like a Charm!]

401
17:34.030 --> 17:39.010
[Authorized Personnel Only]

402
17:44.070 --> 17:45.440
You hooligan!

403
17:45.440 --> 17:47.310
You're pretending to be blind, aren't you?

404
17:47.310 --> 17:48.570
I didn't see anything!

405
17:50.030 --> 17:50.960
How dare you

406
17:50.960 --> 17:52.310
harass me!

407
17:55.110 --> 17:56.440
Pretending to be blind?

408
17:56.440 --> 17:58.240
I'll teach you a lesson for that!

409
17:58.350 --> 17:59.680
How dare you harass me!

410
18:01.720 --> 18:02.960
As long as there's one

411
18:02.960 --> 18:04.310
blind masseur with over 5 years

412
18:04.310 --> 18:05.400
of experience,

413
18:05.400 --> 18:07.600
it can be called a blind massage parlor.

414
18:07.790 --> 18:08.960
How can this be a scam?

415
18:08.960 --> 18:10.550
It's a national regulation.

416
18:10.550 --> 18:11.880
It's not a scam.

417
18:12.550 --> 18:13.880
I have never said

418
18:13.880 --> 18:14.920
I was blind.

419
18:14.920 --> 18:16.120
How can this be a scam?

420
18:16.230 --> 18:17.830
Then why were you wearing sunglasses?

421
18:17.830 --> 18:18.720
Can't I just want to look good?

422
18:18.720 --> 18:20.030
Can't I just want to look cool?

423
18:20.030 --> 18:21.160
Who says someone wearing sunglasses

424
18:21.160 --> 18:22.310
has to be blind?

425
18:22.310 --> 18:23.070
Then when that lady

426
18:23.070 --> 18:23.920
took off her clothes,

427
18:23.920 --> 18:24.880
why didn't you remind her?

428
18:24.880 --> 18:25.440
Remind her?

429
18:25.440 --> 18:26.030
If I had reminded her,

430
18:26.030 --> 18:26.590
wouldn't she have known

431
18:26.590 --> 18:27.880
that I'm not blind?

432
18:28.830 --> 18:29.960
You let it slip, didn't you?

433
18:29.960 --> 18:31.310
Isn't this still a scam?

434
18:32.750 --> 18:33.400
Alright.

435
18:34.310 --> 18:35.110
That hurts.

436
18:35.720 --> 18:36.580
You deserve it.

437
18:37.000 --> 18:38.240
You deserve to be beaten.

438
18:38.240 --> 18:39.200
I must report you.

439
18:39.200 --> 18:40.640
No, no, no. Liu.

440
18:41.030 --> 18:41.720
Seriously,

441
18:41.720 --> 18:42.960
stay and be a masseur here.

442
18:42.960 --> 18:44.240
I'm really short-staffed here.

443
18:44.240 --> 18:45.110
I won't do it.

444
18:46.270 --> 18:47.070
Free training,

445
18:47.070 --> 18:47.750
a base salary of 3,000,

446
18:47.750 --> 18:48.720
and commissions.

447
18:48.720 --> 18:50.000
I won't do it no matter how much you pay me.

448
18:50.000 --> 18:51.830
Why are you so stubborn?

449
18:53.680 --> 18:54.680
Another scammer?

450
18:55.830 --> 18:56.640
Who is it?

451
18:59.550 --> 19:00.830
Looks pretty real.

452
19:02.880 --> 19:03.920
You sneaked up on me again?

453
19:03.920 --> 19:05.580
You sneaked up on my daughter.

454
19:06.550 --> 19:07.350
Your daughter?

455
19:07.350 --> 19:09.270
My biological daughter. Got a problem?

456
19:09.270 --> 19:10.240
Dad, who is it?

457
19:10.310 --> 19:11.440
A new staff member?

458
19:12.270 --> 19:13.350
I took in an apprentice.

459
19:13.350 --> 19:15.080
I'm teaching him acupressure.

460
19:19.960 --> 19:20.750
Morning.

461
19:20.750 --> 19:21.400
Morning.

462
19:23.880 --> 19:25.110
What are you looking at?

463
19:25.110 --> 19:26.310
Look at this guy.

464
19:27.160 --> 19:28.000
Jumping rope.

465
19:33.400 --> 19:34.510
What is he doing?

466
19:35.960 --> 19:37.400
He's a young man after all.

467
19:37.400 --> 19:39.270
So full of energy.

468
19:46.110 --> 19:50.120
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

469
19:54.000 --> 19:56.160
Why are you copying Zhengliang?

470
19:57.030 --> 19:58.200
He taught me this.

471
19:58.830 --> 20:01.030
He was going through something big back then.

472
20:01.030 --> 20:02.360
What's your reason now?

473
20:02.550 --> 20:04.410
I'm going through something too.

474
20:05.200 --> 20:06.510
About the surgery?

475
20:14.590 --> 20:15.590
The surgery

476
20:17.510 --> 20:18.920
really makes me anxious.

477
20:25.550 --> 20:27.920
If you're so afraid of surgery,

478
20:28.160 --> 20:31.620
why did you choose to specialize in surgery in the first place?

479
20:33.200 --> 20:34.550
My dad chose it for me.

480
20:36.440 --> 20:37.900
Let's not talk about this.

481
20:40.200 --> 20:42.160
I've been overthinking lately.

482
20:42.920 --> 20:44.160
Once I start,

483
20:45.270 --> 20:46.310
I can't sleep.

484
20:47.200 --> 20:48.270
When I can't sleep,

485
20:49.240 --> 20:50.830
I feel terrible.

486
20:52.310 --> 20:53.770
Then I keep thinking about

487
20:54.240 --> 20:56.100
making mistakes during surgery.

488
20:58.070 --> 20:58.880
Can't sleep

489
21:00.160 --> 21:01.490
and then feel terrible—

490
21:02.070 --> 21:03.270
it's a vicious cycle.

491
21:04.790 --> 21:05.830
That won't do.

492
21:08.510 --> 21:09.240
How about this?

493
21:09.240 --> 21:11.440
I'll prescribe you some sleeping pills.

494
21:11.440 --> 21:12.840
Taking those won't work.

495
21:13.830 --> 21:16.490
It only treats the symptoms, not the root cause.

496
21:18.550 --> 21:20.550
Do you have any other ideas?

497
21:24.310 --> 21:25.350
I do.

498
21:26.310 --> 21:28.310
I went through the same phase as you.

499
21:28.310 --> 21:29.270
When I was a kid,

500
21:29.590 --> 21:31.120
I got nervous before exams.

501
21:32.720 --> 21:34.440
But my way of dealing with it

502
21:34.880 --> 21:35.940
won't work for you.

503
21:37.480 --> 21:38.880
You haven't even told me.

504
21:39.400 --> 21:41.000
How do you know it won't work?

505
21:41.880 --> 21:42.680
When...

506
21:43.480 --> 21:44.830
When I get nervous,

507
21:44.880 --> 21:46.680
I sing the sing-and-dance duet.

508
21:49.960 --> 21:52.070
♪ Rushing out ♪

509
21:52.160 --> 21:54.510
♪ Rushing out ♪

510
21:54.720 --> 21:56.240
♪ Clomp, clomp, down the stairs ♪

511
21:56.270 --> 21:58.160
♪ Clomp, clomp, down the stairs ♪

512
21:58.200 --> 21:59.920
♪ Walk a mile or two down the road ♪

513
21:59.960 --> 22:01.920
♪ Walk a mile or two down the road ♪

514
22:02.000 --> 22:03.550
♪ Past four or five villages ♪

515
22:03.590 --> 22:05.510
♪ Past four or five villages ♪

516
22:05.550 --> 22:07.350
♪ Over six or seven pavilions ♪

517
22:07.400 --> 22:09.310
♪ Over six or seven pavilions ♪

518
22:09.350 --> 22:12.590
♪ With eight, nine, or ten flowers, to the west wing I go ♪

519
22:12.960 --> 22:16.750
♪ With eight, nine, or ten flowers, to the west wing I go ♪

520
22:17.160 --> 22:19.400
♪ How far is the west wing? ♪

521
22:19.480 --> 22:22.270
♪ How far is the west wing? ♪

522
22:22.400 --> 22:26.350
♪ It's just on the other side of the wall ♪

523
22:27.510 --> 22:31.830
♪ It's just on the other side of the wall ♪

524
22:37.000 --> 22:37.590
Alright.

525
22:37.590 --> 22:38.000
Am I...

526
22:38.000 --> 22:39.070
Not bad. Not bad.

527
22:39.720 --> 22:40.400
Well...

528
22:42.110 --> 22:43.590
Mingming, can you...

529
22:44.400 --> 22:45.930
sing the whole thing for me?

530
22:46.790 --> 22:47.590
Sure.

531
22:47.790 --> 22:48.590
Okay.

532
22:49.400 --> 22:50.680
Here, hold this.

533
22:55.200 --> 22:57.070
♪ Rushing out ♪

534
22:57.270 --> 22:58.680
♪ Clomp, clomp, down the stairs ♪

535
22:58.680 --> 23:00.550
♪ Walk a mile or two down the road ♪

536
23:00.590 --> 23:02.160
♪ Past four or five villages ♪

537
23:02.160 --> 23:03.920
♪ Over six or seven pavilions ♪

538
23:03.920 --> 23:07.270
♪ With eight, nine, or ten flowers, to the west wing I go ♪

539
23:23.590 --> 23:24.400
Thank you.

540
23:25.550 --> 23:27.110
You need to get this straight.

541
23:27.110 --> 23:28.790
ID card,

542
23:28.790 --> 23:30.030
phone number, and the date.

543
23:30.030 --> 23:31.720
They all need to be written clearly.

544
23:31.720 --> 23:33.270
Hello, remember me?

545
23:33.310 --> 23:34.200
Mr. Liu.

546
23:34.200 --> 23:34.750
Yes.

547
23:34.750 --> 23:36.680
Have you found my luggage?

548
23:36.960 --> 23:38.200
Well...

549
23:38.240 --> 23:39.570
we haven't found it yet.

550
23:39.830 --> 23:40.070
Come on.

551
23:40.070 --> 23:42.000
Is it that hard to find a piece of luggage?

552
23:42.000 --> 23:43.030
Wasn't it taken by the old lady

553
23:43.030 --> 23:44.200
in the bunk beneath me?

554
23:44.200 --> 23:44.720
Right?

555
23:44.720 --> 23:46.480
Can't you find her ticket info

556
23:46.510 --> 23:47.110
and phone number,

557
23:47.110 --> 23:48.400
and then call her?

558
23:48.640 --> 23:49.880
Yes, about this matter,

559
23:49.880 --> 23:50.880
we have been

560
23:50.880 --> 23:52.240
actively dealing with it.

561
23:52.240 --> 23:53.240
But we really haven't found

562
23:53.240 --> 23:54.110
that old lady yet.

563
23:54.110 --> 23:54.920
If there are any new developments,

564
23:54.920 --> 23:55.750
I will definitely

565
23:55.750 --> 23:57.000
notify you immediately, okay?

566
23:57.000 --> 23:58.110
I'm really sorry.

567
23:58.160 --> 23:59.270
What's the use of apologizing?

568
23:59.270 --> 24:00.530
Don't apologize to me.

569
24:02.110 --> 24:03.880
I'm also waiting for updates anyway.

570
24:03.880 --> 24:05.200
This is the situation now.

571
24:05.200 --> 24:06.600
There's nothing I can do.

572
24:14.000 --> 24:15.330
Where are we going next?

573
24:15.880 --> 24:17.270
What do you mean "we?"

574
24:18.030 --> 24:19.760
What does it have to do with you?

575
24:20.510 --> 24:21.350
You've been following me all day.

576
24:21.350 --> 24:22.750
What exactly do you want?

577
24:23.440 --> 24:25.000
You want to make money off me, right?

578
24:25.000 --> 24:27.160
Let me tell you, I have no money. I'm very poor.

579
24:27.160 --> 24:29.200
Yes, I can see you're poor.

580
24:29.590 --> 24:31.190
I'm not doing this for money.

581
24:31.510 --> 24:33.110
I just think you're interesting.

582
24:33.110 --> 24:34.070
I can definitely

583
24:34.070 --> 24:35.670
have some fun following you.

584
24:36.200 --> 24:37.680
Isn't this more interesting than

585
24:37.680 --> 24:39.590
playing games in that internet cafe?

586
24:39.590 --> 24:41.120
You're quite interesting.

587
24:41.480 --> 24:42.310
You're like

588
24:42.310 --> 24:43.110
a stubborn, obnoxious

589
24:43.110 --> 24:44.310
piece of crap.

590
24:44.880 --> 24:45.310
I swear

591
24:45.310 --> 24:47.480
I'll go back to the hotel and check out right now.

592
24:47.480 --> 24:49.160
Get out of my sight immediately,

593
24:49.160 --> 24:50.440
or I'll call the police.

594
24:50.440 --> 24:51.750
What will you tell the police?

595
24:51.750 --> 24:52.550
That you're stalking me.

596
24:52.550 --> 24:53.680
But we're friends.

597
24:53.720 --> 24:54.720
Who said we're friends?

598
24:54.720 --> 24:55.480
I don't even know

599
24:55.480 --> 24:56.310
your name.

600
24:58.510 --> 24:59.750
My name is Zhou Zheng.

601
24:59.960 --> 25:01.690
"Zhou Zheng" as in "handsome."

602
25:01.920 --> 25:03.320
You can also call me Pink.

603
25:05.030 --> 25:06.960
Come on, Uncle, let's shake hands.

604
25:07.640 --> 25:09.900
Call me Uncle again, and I'll beat you up.

605
25:11.510 --> 25:12.310
Bro.

606
25:13.270 --> 25:15.000
I'll call you bro. Is that okay?

607
25:26.350 --> 25:27.880
Do you have nothing to do?

608
25:28.240 --> 25:29.310
I really don't.

609
25:29.750 --> 25:31.000
If you have nothing to do, why don't you go to school?

610
25:31.000 --> 25:32.110
I already did.

611
25:33.680 --> 25:34.540
Let me tell you,

612
25:34.920 --> 25:36.200
when I was in school,

613
25:36.270 --> 25:38.330
my grades were actually pretty good.

614
25:39.750 --> 25:40.790
But I think

615
25:41.880 --> 25:43.410
going to school is useless.

616
25:44.720 --> 25:46.000
Your grades were good?

617
25:47.200 --> 25:47.920
I've never seen

618
25:47.920 --> 25:49.000
anyone with good grades

619
25:49.000 --> 25:50.310
sporting pink hair.

620
25:52.590 --> 25:54.200
I'm just letting myself go.

621
25:55.270 --> 25:56.350
If you don't want to go to school,

622
25:56.350 --> 25:57.510
go find a job.

623
26:00.880 --> 26:01.590
Bro.

624
26:02.400 --> 26:04.310
Even a medical doctor like you

625
26:04.400 --> 26:05.550
can't find a job.

626
26:06.240 --> 26:08.240
How could a high school dropout like me

627
26:08.240 --> 26:09.350
find one so easily?

628
26:09.720 --> 26:11.680
Who said I can't find a job?

629
26:12.110 --> 26:12.960
I'm in high demand.

630
26:12.960 --> 26:14.890
How many times do I have to tell you?

631
26:16.790 --> 26:18.830
I can see that. Very much in demand.

632
26:19.830 --> 26:20.510
Bro.

633
26:21.590 --> 26:22.590
Finding a job

634
26:22.960 --> 26:24.400
takes time.

635
26:25.590 --> 26:26.920
You sent your resume to so many hospitals.

636
26:26.920 --> 26:28.720
They need a few days to review it.

637
26:31.960 --> 26:32.820
How about this?

638
26:33.310 --> 26:36.030
It's rare for you to come to Bengbu.

639
26:37.400 --> 26:38.790
I'll show you around.

640
26:39.350 --> 26:40.280
Not interested.

641
26:42.960 --> 26:43.750
My treat.

642
26:45.920 --> 26:47.750
Taxi, meals—

643
26:47.960 --> 26:49.880
all expenses are on me.

644
26:50.510 --> 26:51.510
Generous enough?

645
26:53.720 --> 26:54.980
What's wrong with you?

646
26:56.640 --> 26:58.160
Are you after my kidneys?

647
26:58.350 --> 26:58.960
Bro,

648
26:59.590 --> 27:01.120
what are you talking about?

649
27:01.880 --> 27:03.680
Do I look that much like a bad guy?

650
27:04.880 --> 27:06.350
I'm just bored.

651
27:11.070 --> 27:12.680
Give me another discount on my room.

652
27:12.680 --> 27:14.790
50 is already a huge discount.

653
27:18.720 --> 27:19.310
40.

654
27:19.310 --> 27:19.960
20.

655
27:19.960 --> 27:20.400
38.

656
27:20.400 --> 27:21.110
25.

657
27:21.110 --> 27:21.880
30!

658
27:23.070 --> 27:24.030
30 a day.

659
27:24.350 --> 27:25.590
Not a penny less.

660
27:25.590 --> 27:27.920
Any less and I'll lose my shirt.

661
27:31.830 --> 27:32.640
Is there anything good to eat

662
27:32.640 --> 27:33.920
around here?

663
27:38.000 --> 27:39.400
You asked the right person.

664
27:39.380 --> 27:40.080
♪ What're you looking at? ♪

665
27:41.330 --> 27:42.160
♪ I'm not looking at you ♪

666
27:44.130 --> 27:44.700
♪ Alright then ♪

667
27:45.750 --> 27:46.110
♪ Come on ♪

668
27:48.520 --> 27:50.930
♪ The sun's already high and I'm just getting downstairs ♪

669
27:50.490 --> 27:53.950
[Future] [Happiness]

670
27:51.210 --> 27:53.210
♪ My hair is a flattened mess, like a bird's nest ♪

671
27:53.890 --> 27:55.840
♪ There is nothing much in my pockets ♪

672
27:56.100 --> 27:58.200
♪ I still sway a little as I walk ♪

673
27:58.820 --> 28:00.240
♪ A buddy at the door calls out to me ♪

674
28:00.310 --> 28:01.500
♪ Where are you off to? ♪

675
28:01.570 --> 28:02.760
♪ I say I don't know yet ♪

676
28:02.920 --> 28:04.140
♪ Just gonna head on forward ♪

677
28:04.240 --> 28:06.830
♪ And see where I end up ♪

678
28:07.000 --> 28:09.340
♪ Anyway, there isn't much to do at home ♪

679
28:10.090 --> 28:10.780
♪ Just wandering around ♪

680
28:11.270 --> 28:12.100
♪ Just wandering around ♪

681
28:12.340 --> 28:14.060
♪ Always wandering around ♪

682
28:15.600 --> 28:16.280
♪ Look to the left ♪

683
28:16.590 --> 28:17.420
♪ Look to the right ♪

684
28:17.710 --> 28:19.650
♪ Whose doorway has a crowd gathered around it? ♪

685
28:19.870 --> 28:20.670
♪ What're you looking at? ♪

686
28:21.470 --> 28:22.340
♪ I'm joining the fun ♪

687
28:22.740 --> 28:25.080
♪ There's no fun to join ♪

688
28:24.480 --> 28:25.960
You're having the worst luck.

689
28:25.510 --> 28:26.350
♪ There's nothing to see here ♪

690
28:26.910 --> 28:27.770
♪ Bored out of my mind ♪

691
28:28.030 --> 28:30.540
♪ I just can't keep up with you ♪

692
28:30.110 --> 28:31.370
It's not a big problem.

693
28:31.580 --> 28:32.740
♪ Oh my ♪

694
28:33.140 --> 28:34.080
♪ I may be broke ♪

695
28:33.510 --> 28:35.510
Eat up. Eat more. Finish it.

696
28:34.290 --> 28:35.990
♪ But we still have to look the part ♪

697
28:35.830 --> 28:37.070
If it's not enough, you can have my bowl.

698
28:36.970 --> 28:37.770
♪ Just wandering around ♪

699
28:37.070 --> 28:38.880
Mr. Bird, what have you been eating lately?

700
28:38.290 --> 28:39.080
♪ Just wandering around ♪

701
28:39.540 --> 28:42.080
♪ Young people don't make that many plans ♪

702
28:39.960 --> 28:41.690
You've got the runs pretty bad.

703
28:42.330 --> 28:44.420
♪ The sun's pretty nice today ♪

704
28:42.720 --> 28:43.850
Do you have tissues?

705
28:44.850 --> 28:47.400
♪ Let's go out and not waste the day ♪

706
28:46.920 --> 28:47.790
This is

707
28:47.790 --> 28:50.310
the most famous sculpture in Zhucheng.

708
28:50.680 --> 28:52.720
I think some master sculptor made it.

709
28:51.790 --> 28:55.190
[Marker of the North-South Divide in China]

710
28:55.960 --> 28:56.690
Look at that.

711
28:58.960 --> 29:00.310
Blue is north.

712
29:00.400 --> 29:01.480
Red is south.

713
29:02.830 --> 29:03.760
What do you mean?

714
29:04.510 --> 29:05.310
Bengbu

715
29:05.590 --> 29:08.990
is on the dividing line between northern and southern China.

716
29:10.110 --> 29:10.750
Look.

717
29:10.860 --> 29:14.870
[For Dramatic Purposes Only. Do Not Imitate.]

718
29:13.550 --> 29:14.950
This is the north, right?

719
29:17.070 --> 29:18.200
I'm in the south now.

720
29:20.030 --> 29:21.430
Now I'm back in the north.

721
29:22.830 --> 29:24.560
Look, I'm back in the south now.

722
29:26.400 --> 29:29.480
I call this traveling extensively.

723
29:30.200 --> 29:31.350
Wow, amazing.

724
29:31.440 --> 29:32.590
You try it.

725
29:31.570 --> 29:38.800
[Marker of the North-South Divide in China]

726
29:32.680 --> 29:33.830
I won't.

727
29:33.830 --> 29:35.350
Since we're here. Come on.

728
29:35.480 --> 29:35.960
Come on.

729
29:38.750 --> 29:40.280
Every time I jump like this,

730
29:40.920 --> 29:42.200
it brings me good luck.

731
29:42.440 --> 29:43.030
I think

732
29:43.030 --> 29:44.560
you're a bit unlucky today.

733
29:45.350 --> 29:46.830
Try jumping a few times.

734
29:46.920 --> 29:48.720
Maybe your bad luck will go away.

735
29:50.720 --> 29:51.400
Try it.

736
29:54.540 --> 29:57.990
[For Dramatic Purposes Only. Do Not Imitate.]

737
30:00.480 --> 30:01.310
In the north.

738
30:01.920 --> 30:03.000
Back in the south.

739
30:04.110 --> 30:05.310
In the north again.

740
30:09.310 --> 30:10.240
Boring.

741
30:13.070 --> 30:14.400
Jump back to the south!

742
30:16.030 --> 30:16.830
Zhengliang.

743
30:17.110 --> 30:18.920
Let's go to the amusement park tomorrow.

744
30:18.920 --> 30:20.480
I want to ride the roller coaster.

745
30:20.480 --> 30:21.280
I'm not going.

746
30:21.640 --> 30:24.500
I'm going to stay in my room and look at job postings.

747
30:24.510 --> 30:28.120
[Zheng's Dental Clinic]

748
30:24.720 --> 30:26.070
I'll help you look later.

749
30:26.070 --> 30:26.960
I promise I'll find

750
30:26.960 --> 30:28.200
10 more hospitals for you tonight.

751
30:28.200 --> 30:29.200
I'm still not going.

752
30:28.230 --> 30:31.230
[Jiajiale Department Store]

753
30:29.720 --> 30:31.070
Running around outside with you

754
30:31.070 --> 30:33.000
is more tiring than doing surgery.

755
30:34.030 --> 30:34.830
Well,

756
30:34.890 --> 30:39.830
[Zheng's Dental Clinic]

757
30:35.200 --> 30:36.070
why don't you tell me

758
30:36.070 --> 30:38.070
about the most difficult

759
30:38.070 --> 30:39.530
surgery you've ever done?

760
30:39.590 --> 30:41.450
You wouldn't understand anyway.

761
30:42.400 --> 30:43.480
Just tell me.

762
30:46.200 --> 30:47.400
Have you ever

763
30:47.480 --> 30:49.240
brought someone back to life

764
30:50.240 --> 30:51.200
when they were

765
30:51.200 --> 30:52.310
definitely going to die?

766
30:52.310 --> 30:54.310
That's contradictory.

767
30:54.590 --> 30:57.790
If they can be saved, they're not definitely going to die.

768
30:58.960 --> 30:59.640
Come on.

769
30:59.640 --> 31:01.070
You definitely know

770
31:01.640 --> 31:02.640
what I mean.

771
31:03.480 --> 31:04.310
True.

772
31:04.790 --> 31:05.480
If you really had

773
31:05.480 --> 31:06.680
such great skills,

774
31:07.350 --> 31:09.240
you wouldn't have trouble finding a job.

775
31:09.240 --> 31:11.000
I've told you 100 times.

776
31:11.440 --> 31:12.680
I encountered an unexpected situation

777
31:12.680 --> 31:14.030
and am going through a rough patch.

778
31:14.030 --> 31:14.920
Understand?

779
31:19.070 --> 31:19.880
I understand.

780
31:20.510 --> 31:21.910
It's like playing a game.

781
31:22.440 --> 31:23.510
There's a network lag,

782
31:23.510 --> 31:24.840
and the screen freezes.

783
31:31.510 --> 31:33.040
Someone is looking for you.

784
31:33.920 --> 31:34.720
Who?

785
31:36.550 --> 31:37.110
Me.

786
31:40.880 --> 31:43.080
Do we still have anything to talk about?

787
31:50.200 --> 31:51.000
Big Brother.

788
31:51.510 --> 31:53.000
How did you find me here?

789
31:54.310 --> 31:55.110
What?

790
31:57.270 --> 31:58.310
Did you fall in love with me?

791
31:58.310 --> 31:59.200
Oh my goodness.

792
31:59.200 --> 32:01.000
You still dare to be so glib here?

793
32:01.720 --> 32:03.250
Aren't you afraid of death?

794
32:08.960 --> 32:10.090
This place is small.

795
32:10.640 --> 32:12.300
There's no room for fighting.

796
32:13.030 --> 32:14.490
Let's go outside and talk.

797
32:21.070 --> 32:22.130
Don't play tricks.

798
32:42.270 --> 32:43.400
Call the police now.

799
32:43.720 --> 32:44.750
Why?

800
32:45.030 --> 32:45.750
Those people are here

801
32:45.750 --> 32:47.350
to make trouble for your son.

802
32:47.350 --> 32:48.110
Let them.

803
32:48.110 --> 32:49.640
It has nothing to do with me.

804
32:51.270 --> 32:52.510
He's young and ignorant.

805
32:52.510 --> 32:53.070
But as his mother,

806
32:53.070 --> 32:54.200
how can you say that?

807
32:54.920 --> 32:56.270
So what should I say?

808
32:56.920 --> 32:57.920
I just said a few words to him,

809
32:57.920 --> 32:59.270
and he cut ties with me.

810
32:59.270 --> 33:00.640
Fine by me.

811
33:08.590 --> 33:09.590
They're really hitting him.

812
33:09.590 --> 33:10.520
Call the police.

813
33:10.640 --> 33:11.970
He's your son after all.

814
33:12.640 --> 33:14.030
If I can't keep him in line,

815
33:14.030 --> 33:15.510
let society do it.

816
33:15.590 --> 33:17.320
That's fine. I won't stop them.

817
33:17.720 --> 33:19.380
If you want to call the police,

818
33:19.510 --> 33:20.920
go outside and do it.

819
33:21.720 --> 33:22.310
If the police come,

820
33:22.310 --> 33:24.240
I won't be able to do business here.

821
33:24.310 --> 33:25.160
Landlady!

822
33:25.720 --> 33:27.510
There's no hot water on the second floor!

823
33:27.510 --> 33:28.400
Coming!

824
33:29.110 --> 33:30.310
The work never ends.

825
33:30.680 --> 33:31.480
Coming!

826
33:31.880 --> 33:34.080
Are you really not going to do anything?

827
33:36.400 --> 33:37.860
What kind of person is she?

828
33:45.240 --> 33:45.900
Do it again.

829
33:51.510 --> 33:52.480
No wonder

830
33:53.720 --> 33:55.400
your girlfriend says you're a weak man.

831
33:55.400 --> 33:56.680
You hit like a wimp.

832
33:57.830 --> 33:59.030
Here. Slap this side.

833
34:04.200 --> 34:05.000
Keep going.

834
34:06.920 --> 34:07.720
Big Brother,

835
34:07.720 --> 34:09.440
that slap was great.

836
34:09.510 --> 34:10.800
How could it be so amazing?

837
34:10.800 --> 34:11.590
Keep going. Don't stop.

838
34:11.590 --> 34:12.280
Come on.

839
34:12.320 --> 34:13.380
Put the phone down!

840
34:14.230 --> 34:15.590
Stop yelling here.

841
34:16.630 --> 34:17.690
This is my brother.

842
34:18.030 --> 34:19.429
He has a heart condition.

843
34:19.630 --> 34:21.510
If you want to hit him, beat him to death.

844
34:21.510 --> 34:22.230
That way, our family

845
34:22.230 --> 34:23.710
can get compensation.

846
34:24.030 --> 34:25.760
Then I'll have money to get a wife

847
34:25.760 --> 34:26.800
and buy a house.

848
34:27.510 --> 34:28.800
Who are you trying to scare?

849
34:28.800 --> 34:30.230
I'm not scaring you.

850
34:30.320 --> 34:31.150
I'm cheering for you.

851
34:31.150 --> 34:32.110
Come on. Keep going.

852
34:32.110 --> 34:33.360
-Come on. -Take his phone!

853
34:33.360 --> 34:35.159
Lay a finger on me and you'll see.

854
34:35.510 --> 34:36.440
Just a reminder.

855
34:36.960 --> 34:38.070
I called the police.

856
34:38.070 --> 34:39.000
If you want to hit him, hurry up.

857
34:39.000 --> 34:40.600
-Come on. Hurry up. -Come on.

858
34:41.800 --> 34:42.730
Beat me to death!

859
34:46.280 --> 34:47.550
If you dare talk nonsense to the police,

860
34:47.550 --> 34:48.800
I'll burn your shop down!

861
34:48.800 --> 34:49.860
I'll remember you!

862
34:51.110 --> 34:51.800
Come on!

863
35:05.760 --> 35:07.490
Whoever backs down is a coward!

864
35:12.510 --> 35:14.400
Alright, they're gone.

865
35:20.150 --> 35:20.960
Are you okay?

866
35:23.920 --> 35:24.850
It's no big deal.

867
35:25.920 --> 35:27.550
I'll be fine after some sleep.

868
35:27.550 --> 35:29.410
How did you provoke that bald guy?

869
35:33.150 --> 35:34.750
I slept with his girlfriend.

870
35:36.670 --> 35:38.000
You really deserved it.

871
35:40.280 --> 35:41.190
Can you walk?

872
35:41.230 --> 35:42.760
I'll take you to the hospital.

873
35:42.760 --> 35:44.020
Who are you insulting?

874
35:52.670 --> 35:53.760
Wow, amazing.

875
35:56.550 --> 35:59.440
It won't stop me from riding the roller coaster tomorrow.

876
35:59.440 --> 36:00.230
Don't you understand my words?

877
36:00.230 --> 36:01.360
I said I'm not going.

878
36:01.710 --> 36:02.510
Come on.

879
36:04.190 --> 36:05.510
I even got beaten up.

880
36:06.920 --> 36:07.720
Can't you just

881
36:08.190 --> 36:09.190
grant me this one

882
36:09.190 --> 36:10.230
small wish?

883
36:10.230 --> 36:11.110
Do you think I'm Aladdin's lamp?

884
36:11.110 --> 36:12.360
Granting your wish?

885
36:12.550 --> 36:13.440
Go by yourself.

886
36:14.320 --> 36:15.630
Don't get handsy with me!

887
36:15.630 --> 36:16.190
Bro!

888
36:18.360 --> 36:19.230
Brother!

889
36:21.960 --> 36:23.070
I'm scared to do it alone.

890
36:23.070 --> 36:23.880
Don't push your luck.

891
36:23.880 --> 36:24.710
You disgust me.

892
36:24.710 --> 36:25.910
I'm not your brother!

893
36:27.920 --> 36:29.800
You just admitted right here

894
36:29.800 --> 36:31.060
that I'm your brother.

895
36:31.710 --> 36:33.840
How could you change your tune so fast?

896
36:35.070 --> 36:37.070
Yes, I do have a younger brother.

897
36:37.710 --> 36:39.440
He's an idiot just like you,

898
36:39.840 --> 36:40.800
but he's not you.

899
36:42.440 --> 36:43.500
You have a brother?

900
36:44.630 --> 36:46.160
Do you have the same mother?

901
36:46.280 --> 36:47.960
What does it have to do with you? Get lost.

902
36:47.960 --> 36:49.280
I just want to know.

903
36:50.920 --> 36:52.630
Let me guess his name.

904
36:54.710 --> 36:55.630
Liu Zheng'an?

905
36:57.710 --> 36:58.400
No?

906
36:59.920 --> 37:00.780
Liu Zhengdeng?

907
37:05.800 --> 37:06.760
Liu Zhengjian!

908
37:07.510 --> 37:09.070
You're "jian" (low).

909
37:09.300 --> 37:18.490
[Dream Garden Themed Hotel]

910
37:12.320 --> 37:13.670
I was just kidding.

911
37:15.630 --> 37:16.440
Zhengliang!

912
37:48.670 --> 37:50.550
Still working this late?

913
37:50.760 --> 37:51.400
Look.

914
37:52.070 --> 37:52.760
You must be hungry.

915
37:52.760 --> 37:53.880
I made you some late night snacks.

916
37:53.880 --> 37:55.080
Eat it while it's hot.

917
37:55.360 --> 37:56.160
Wait a minute.

918
37:56.440 --> 37:56.880
How could you

919
37:56.880 --> 37:58.070
just walk into my room?

920
37:58.070 --> 37:59.930
This is an invasion of my privacy.

921
38:03.070 --> 38:04.110
We're not strangers.

922
38:04.110 --> 38:05.510
Aren't we family now?

923
38:05.960 --> 38:07.490
You're friends with my son,

924
38:07.920 --> 38:09.590
so you're like half a son to me.

925
38:12.550 --> 38:14.010
I'm not your son's friend.

926
38:15.000 --> 38:17.110
Besides, I'm only a few years younger than you.

927
38:17.110 --> 38:18.320
I can't be your son.

928
38:19.510 --> 38:20.550
I don't eat late night snacks.

929
38:20.550 --> 38:21.320
Take it away,

930
38:21.320 --> 38:22.980
and close the door behind you.

931
38:26.230 --> 38:27.070
Young man.

932
38:28.320 --> 38:29.150
Sometimes,

933
38:29.630 --> 38:30.360
food

934
38:30.360 --> 38:31.510
is not just for filling

935
38:31.510 --> 38:32.750
your stomach.

936
38:33.190 --> 38:35.000
It's for filling your heart.

937
38:37.230 --> 38:39.230
You're all alone in a strange place,

938
38:39.400 --> 38:40.760
working in the middle of the night.

939
38:40.760 --> 38:42.110
How can you go hungry?

940
38:42.920 --> 38:44.110
If your mother knew,

941
38:44.110 --> 38:45.360
how sad she would be.

942
38:47.760 --> 38:49.880
Come on. Eat up.

943
38:50.320 --> 38:51.520
I know you're hungry.

944
38:52.000 --> 38:52.800
Come on.

945
38:53.800 --> 38:55.760
These are my specialties.

946
38:56.510 --> 38:57.320
Try them.

947
38:57.760 --> 38:59.110
They taste like home.

948
38:59.360 --> 39:00.360
Taste like home?

949
39:01.480 --> 39:02.320
How much is it?

950
39:04.190 --> 39:04.960
The rice,

951
39:05.550 --> 39:06.550
these two dishes,

952
39:07.670 --> 39:09.150
the chopsticks, the bowl,

953
39:09.760 --> 39:12.090
and this tray—you charge for them, right?

954
39:12.630 --> 39:14.230
How much? Give me a number.

955
39:26.230 --> 39:27.670
I raised my son to be useless,

956
39:27.670 --> 39:28.630
and that's fine,

957
39:29.670 --> 39:31.190
but someone like you...

958
39:35.280 --> 39:37.010
I just want to ask you one thing.

959
39:37.920 --> 39:39.840
Does an educated person like you

960
39:40.400 --> 39:41.400
also not believe

961
39:41.400 --> 39:43.730
that there is true kindness in this world?

962
39:52.010 --> 39:55.730
[Accommodation]

963
39:59.440 --> 40:00.440
How does it taste?

964
40:12.340 --> 40:14.470
[WeChat Pay Recommended]

965
40:12.670 --> 40:14.070
80, fixed price.

966
40:14.630 --> 40:16.160
Just scan the QR code to pay.

967
40:23.070 --> 40:24.530
You really are his mother.

968
40:27.960 --> 40:29.930
[Health Conservation]

969
40:30.630 --> 40:31.510
You were the one nagging about wanting

970
40:31.510 --> 40:32.770
radish meatball soup.

971
40:33.070 --> 40:34.190
My wife got up early

972
40:34.190 --> 40:35.440
just to make it for you.

973
40:35.440 --> 40:36.800
And you just took such a tiny sip?

974
40:36.800 --> 40:38.440
Aren't you just messing with us?

975
40:38.440 --> 40:39.840
Who can drink

976
40:39.840 --> 40:40.920
this greasy

977
40:40.920 --> 40:42.650
meat soup early in the morning?

978
40:43.550 --> 40:44.400
Alright, alright.

979
40:44.400 --> 40:45.920
Don't make her go to all that trouble anymore.

980
40:45.920 --> 40:47.180
Do you think we want to?

981
40:47.400 --> 40:48.320
We're already exhausted

982
40:48.320 --> 40:49.150
from work every day!

983
40:49.150 --> 40:50.400
And we have to be here to take care of you!

984
40:50.400 --> 40:51.230
Then just do

985
40:51.230 --> 40:52.150
your own thing.

986
40:52.150 --> 40:52.960
I...

987
40:52.960 --> 40:54.280
I don't need you to take care of me.

988
40:54.280 --> 40:55.230
What did you tell the nurse?

989
40:55.230 --> 40:56.230
What did I say?

990
40:56.280 --> 40:57.480
That we don't care about you!

991
40:57.480 --> 40:58.550
Did you say that?

992
40:59.320 --> 41:00.550
Now you're pretending to be polite to me.

993
41:00.550 --> 41:01.670
Stop pretending!

994
41:01.960 --> 41:03.090
When people get old,

995
41:03.880 --> 41:05.410
they just become annoying.

996
41:07.710 --> 41:09.110
If your mom were alive,

997
41:09.110 --> 41:10.230
-You're doing this again. -I wouldn't have...

998
41:10.230 --> 41:11.030
You're pulling this stunt again,

999
41:11.030 --> 41:11.760
aren't you?

1000
41:11.880 --> 41:13.400
We told you to have surgery, and you refused.

1001
41:13.400 --> 41:14.360
You're just lying here every day.

1002
41:14.360 --> 41:15.280
Who are you trying

1003
41:15.280 --> 41:16.400
to get sympathy from?

1004
41:16.400 --> 41:17.670
Do you own a mountain of gold or silver?

1005
41:17.670 --> 41:18.710
Doesn't surgery cost money?

1006
41:18.710 --> 41:20.110
Do whatever you want!

1007
41:20.400 --> 41:21.200
Nobody cares!

1008
41:31.880 --> 41:33.440
Bed 35, how are you feeling today?

1009
41:33.440 --> 41:34.190
Not bad.

1010
41:35.670 --> 41:36.670
Where is Li?

1011
41:36.840 --> 41:37.840
He went out.

1012
41:38.150 --> 41:39.190
He went out?

1013
41:45.830 --> 41:48.410
[Nurses' Station]

1014
41:54.070 --> 41:55.190
Where is Bed 36?

1015
41:55.440 --> 41:57.030
He went to the bathroom, I think.

1016
41:57.030 --> 41:57.840
You think?

1017
41:57.920 --> 41:59.380
How long has he been there?

1018
42:00.630 --> 42:01.760
20 minutes.

1019
42:02.000 --> 42:03.000
What if he fell

1020
42:03.000 --> 42:03.930
in the bathroom?

1021
42:04.030 --> 42:06.030
Hurry up and get a man to check on him.

1022
42:07.670 --> 42:08.930
Chief Physician Tong.

1023
42:16.670 --> 42:17.360
Is he there?

1024
42:17.360 --> 42:18.290
He's not inside.

1025
42:18.970 --> 42:20.400
I just checked.

1026
42:20.510 --> 42:21.360
Li's shoes and coat

1027
42:21.360 --> 42:22.360
are gone.

1028
42:22.630 --> 42:24.030
He has Alzheimer's.

1029
42:24.280 --> 42:25.630
If he really wanders off in the hospital,

1030
42:25.630 --> 42:27.110
even if he left on his own,

1031
42:27.110 --> 42:29.000
we will have to bear most of the responsibility.

1032
42:29.000 --> 42:29.800
Have someone stay behind.

1033
42:29.800 --> 42:31.280
Tell everyone else who's available

1034
42:31.280 --> 42:32.540
to search every floor.

1035
42:32.630 --> 42:33.670
I'll go to the first floor to check the surveillance.

1036
42:33.670 --> 42:34.320
Okay.

1037
42:36.400 --> 42:37.660
Going home after work?

1038
42:37.880 --> 42:39.190
Why haven't you left yet?

1039
42:39.190 --> 42:40.390
I was waiting for you.

1040
42:40.480 --> 42:41.230
Why were you waiting for me?

1041
42:41.230 --> 42:42.290
Can I walk you home?

1042
42:43.190 --> 42:44.590
Why? Is something wrong?

1043
42:44.920 --> 42:46.480
I just feel so uptight.

1044
42:46.480 --> 42:47.540
I can't relax.

1045
42:48.030 --> 42:50.150
Can you teach me a couple of sing-and-dance duets?

1046
42:50.150 --> 42:51.880
Didn't you say it doesn't work?

1047
42:53.960 --> 42:55.360
As long as it distracts me,

1048
42:55.360 --> 42:56.760
I'll do whatever you say.

1049
42:58.710 --> 43:00.360
Then you might as well go to a bar,

1050
43:00.360 --> 43:01.920
find a beautiful woman to have a drink with,

1051
43:01.920 --> 43:03.030
and then treat her to a meal.

1052
43:03.030 --> 43:04.630
If you succeed, you're the one who benefits.

1053
43:04.630 --> 43:05.630
If you fail,

1054
43:05.630 --> 43:07.400
at least it'll help you blow off some steam.

1055
43:07.400 --> 43:08.000
Wait a minute.

1056
43:08.000 --> 43:09.260
You two, wait a minute!

1057
43:10.230 --> 43:11.320
Li is missing.
